# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Libraries
# Fetched at release by .pkgmeta (oUF at its pinned tag); embeds.xml is ours and the .toc's only way in.
# AeonSettings is the exception: its sync script vendors it, renamed for AeonUI, and the copy is committed.
# Excluding the contents rather than the folder is what lets the negation apply.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/Libs/*
!/Libs/embeds.xml
!/Libs/AeonSettings/

